WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600
Monday. Twelve rolls of stretch film.
Enough for the week?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Tuesday.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.400
"Customer needs 20 rolls on Friday."
It’s going faster than you think.

4
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.900
Wednesday. Meet Janka.
It sees the shortfall coming, and drafts the order.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.200
A person approves. Always.

6
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.800
Thursday. Delivery, read from a photo.
Janka’s AI fills in the lines. Ravi checks them.

7
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.600
And the stock that isn’t moving?
Janka points it out, before it ties up more cash.

8
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.200
Friday. Twenty rolls out.
Still in stock.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.600
One week. No guessing.

10
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:40.000
Janka. Stock you won’t run out of.
antarax.ai/janka

